# Files that must NOT be uploaded as static assets.
#
# Derived 2026-09-05 by probing every file in this repo against production.
# Everything listed here returns 404 on augustineevents.com today, so excluding
# it changes nothing a visitor can see. Everything NOT listed here is currently
# served by the live site (34 files) and must keep being served.

# --- tooling / repo metadata (never web content) ---
# The site lives at the repo root, so the assets directory contains .git.
# Without these, wrangler tries to upload the 155 MB pack file and fails.
**/.git
**/.git/**
**/.DS_Store
**/node_modules
.gitignore
.assetsignore
wrangler.jsonc
CLAUDE.md

# CNAME is a GitHub Pages artifact pointing at www.augustineevents.com, a
# hostname with no DNS record. Not served in production. See CLAUDE.md.
CNAME

